**Definition 3.3 (four observations of a target cut).** For $h\in\Omega_2$,
define independently

$$
\begin{aligned}
S(h)&=\operatorname{Pos}(U_2(Y(h))),\\
B(h)&=\operatorname{Leaves}(U_2(Y(h))),\\
T(h)&=\text{the ordered actual }\Pi_2\text{ patch occurrences from the foundation},\\
M(h)&=\text{the selected retained backing/frontier/rights of Definition 4.1}.
\end{aligned}
\tag{PVC.4}
$$

$S$ is support of actual storage, $B$ its terminal antichain, $T$ the actual
operation order, and $M$ existing retained relations. Access links are
determined by mark tracks, not additional arbitrary addresses. None is
defined as a copy of a replay key, an intersection of kernels, the private
source shape alone or a decorated event tree.

